@startuml 12-营销活动与消息通知流程图
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam backgroundColor white
title 图2-11 营销活动与消息通知流程图

|管理员|
start
:进入 admin-marketing;
if (活动类型?) then (满减/折扣券)
  :CRUD /api/admin/marketing/coupons;
  :写入 coupons 表;
elseif (组团游) then
  :CRUD /api/admin/marketing/group;
elseif (新手礼包) then
  :CRUD /api/admin/marketing/newuser;
else (限时折扣)
  :CRUD /api/admin/marketing/discounts;
endif

|用户|
:首页查看优惠活动;
:领取礼包或积分兑换优惠券;
:写入 user_coupons 等表;
:下单时自动匹配可用券;

|系统|
:订单/派单/活动触发通知;
:INSERT notifications;

|用户|
:GET notifications 消息列表;
:PUT notifications/read 标记已读;
stop
@enduml
